  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">S&#xf8;rfond - Norwegian South Film Fund 2020 - 2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of S&#xf8;rfond is to to strengthening the production of films in developing countries where such production is limited by political or economic causes. Further, the grant shall contribute to strengthening film as a cultural expression, to promote diversity and artistic integrity on the international film scene, and to strengthen freedom of expression. The grant shall also contribute to an increased cooperation between Norwegian and international film industries.</narrative>
  </description>
